{%- comment -%}
Uptime Kuma's webhook body for Apprise (compose/apprise), as the sender
"uptime": one Discord card per change, the stripe saying down or back. Set
on the "Apprise (alerts)" notification, Webhook, custom body; README.md.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hb = heartbeatJSON -%}
{%- if hb == nil -%}
  {%- assign kind = "info" -%}
  {%- capture title -%}Test from Uptime Kuma{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture body -%}**Address**  {{ hostnameOrURL }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- elsif hb.status == 0 -%}
  {%- assign kind = "failure" -%}
  {%- capture title -%}{{ name }} is down{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture body -%}**Error**  {{ hb.msg }}
**Since**  {{ hb.time | slice: 11, 5 }} UTC
**Address**  {{ hostnameOrURL }}
**Check**  {{ monitorJSON.type | default: "-" }}, every {{ monitorJSON.interval | default: "?" }} s{%- endcapture -%}
{%- elsif hb.status == 1 -%}
  {%- assign kind = "success" -%}
  {%- capture title -%}{{ name }} is back{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture down_for -%}
    {%- if hb.lastDownTime -%}
      {%- assign up_at = hb.time | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- assign down_at = hb.lastDownTime | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- assign secs = up_at | minus: down_at -%}
      {%- if secs < 60 -%}{{ secs }} s
      {%- elsif secs < 3600 -%}{{ secs | divided_by: 60 }} min
      {%- else -%}{{ secs | divided_by: 3600 }} h {{ secs | modulo: 3600 | divided_by: 60 }} min{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture body -%}{%- if down_for != "" -%}**Down for**  {{ down_for }}
{% endif -%}**Ping**  {{ hb.ping | default: "-" }} ms
**Address**  {{ hostnameOrURL }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign kind = "info" -%}
  {%- capture title -%}{{ name }}: {{ status }}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture body -%}{{ hb.msg }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}
{"tag": "alerts", "type": {{ kind | json }}, "title": {{ title | json }}, "body": {{ body | json }}, "format": "markdown"}
